# The base product's migrations this branch carries — config/migrate.js, PHARMACY_EDITION.md §3.
#
# Numbers 001–899 belong to `main`. Every file below 900 in src/migrations must be listed
# here with this exact hash, so a pharmacy change written into the base range fails
# migration-ranges.test.js instead of colliding, later, with main's file of that number.
#
# When a merge from main brings a new base migration, add its line in the same merge:
#   sha256sum src/migrations/0NN_name.sql
# If the new file did NOT come from main, it is an edition migration: renumber it to 9NN.
